# Essay workspaces and private material must never be committed.
# Anchored so the plugin folder plugins/betterpaper/ is not hidden.
/betterpaper/
**/drafts/
**/reviews/
**/reviewer-notes/
**/anchors/
**/sources/

# The fictional demo essay under examples/ is the only exception.
!/examples/**/drafts/
!/examples/**/reviews/
!/examples/**/reviewer-notes/
!/examples/**/anchors/
!/examples/**/sources/

.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
